        "description": "Laboratory confirmation of megaloblastic anemia with macrocytic red blood cells and vitamin B12 or folate deficiency",
        "category": "major",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": true
      },
      {
        "id": "clinical-features",
        "description": "Presence of gastrointestinal symptoms including abdominal pain and malabsorption",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of cystic fibrosis confirmed by genetic or sweat test, plus histological gastritis and laboratory confirmed megaloblastic anemia",
    "notes": "Diagnosis requires multidisciplinary evaluation including pulmonology, gastroenterology, and hematology."
  },
