      "Elevated serum gastrin levels",
      "Presence of hypersegmented neutrophils on peripheral smear"
    ],
    "imaging": [
      "Chest radiograph showing bronchiectasis",
      "Abdominal ultrasound showing pancreatic atrophy"
    ],
    "genetic": [
      "Pathogenic mutations in the CFTR gene",
      "Autosomal recessive inheritance"
    ],
    "other": [
      "Gastric biopsy showing chronic atrophic gastritis with intestinal metaplasia"
    ]
  },
  "differentialDiagnoses": [
